# Claude Code session state (worktrees, scratch files). A worktree under
# here can carry its own bazel-<name> convenience symlink into a *different*
# Bazel invocation's output tree; without this, `bazel build ...`/`//...`
# recurses into it as if it were part of this repo and fails to load it
# (its external/ repos aren't visible from this repo's own module graph).
.claude/
